			<div class="content" id="post-content-3689972">
									

<p>Sometimes, all I want from an article is some clever humour, a good story arc and some badass fight scenes, and this delivers on all accounts. The dialogue is tight, the action engaging, and I could read the whole thing quickly and still feel satisfied &#8212; a major plus in my book. You handled an initially absurd concept very well, and it didn't seem as <em>forced</em> as some other articles with similar themes. I'm also becoming increasingly aware of Samsara's &quot;badass MTF&quot; status, which is something I wholeheartedly support: the site needs more explosions, goddammit.</p>
<p>There's almost nothing here that even <em>hints</em> at a downvote for me, you play off all the elements so well. I don't have a huge amount more to say that hasn't been said by Shaggy or Nanaya above me, except a congratulations for writing possibly my favourite Abrahamic scip on the site. Well done, +1.</p>

