<p>It's not my usual cup of tea (not that&#8230; my usual &quot;cup of tea&quot; for scps skews this direction in the first place, but y'know) but I like this look at the Tower of Babel. I already knew this was about the Tower of Babel before from hearing you talk about it in chat, but I didn't read any of the earlier drafts so I had no idea that this was the direction you were taking it; I'd actually assumed it would be more about the tower itself and possibly human folly of believing in the ability to reach God.</p>
<p>I was going to ask if there's any reason within the context of this SCP for God's apparent loss of power, but I guess it's not really necessary to know. For whatever reason, God's gone from knocking down the Tower of Babel in one fell swoop to not even being able to keep the ruins from being invaded.</p>

